Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:41.60,Hook,,0,0,0,,¿TOS DE GATO?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.12,0:00:01.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Por qué todos están\Nenfermos, hermano?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.98,0:00:03.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Ah, bueno.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.40,0:00:05.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Mil disculpas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:08.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Supongo que debería\Ncontrolar mi tos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.34,0:00:09.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Gracias.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.39,0:00:12.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¿Así está mejor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.97,0:00:15.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Un poco asqueroso al\Nfinal, pero sí.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.83,0:00:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Chicos, tengo...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.93,0:00:19.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—¡Estás escupiendo una\Nbola de pelo!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.47,0:00:20.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Qué asco.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.58,0:00:25.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Estuve practicando mi rol\Nde gato.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.32,0:00:29.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Ya, ¿puedes parar,\Nhermano?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.28,0:00:30.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Qué carajo significa eso?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.70,0:00:31.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Voy a apagar la radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.64,0:00:33.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}¿Ahora eres furry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:35.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}—Bueno, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.08,0:00:38.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}No, no quise decir eso,\NHarry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.52,0:00:41.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(60,0)}Pero entiendo que\Npareciera eso.
